"vols.\n"
"         Restart je nemoguć ... duplicity će očistiti posljednji parcijalni\n"
"         backup i ponovo ga pokrenuti."

#: ../duplicity/dup_main.py:1543
msgid ""
"\n"
"PYTHONOPTIMIZE in the environment causes duplicity to fail to\n"
"recognize its own backups.  Please remove PYTHONOPTIMIZE from\n"
"the environment and rerun the backup.\n"
"\n"
"See https://bugs.launchpad.net/duplicity/+bug/931175\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"PYTHONOPTIMIZE u okolini uzrokuje dvoličnost da ne \n"
"prepoznaju vlastite kopije. Molim Vas uklonite PYTHONOPTIMIZEiz\n"
"okoline i vratite kopije.\n"
"Pogledajte https://bugs.launchpad.net/duplicity/+bug/931175\n"

